@host = http://localhost:5086

### Kategooriad
GET {{host}}/api/Categories/List/1/10

### Üks toode
GET {{host}}/api/Products/Get?Id=1

### Tooted kategooria järgi
GET {{host}}/api/Products/List/1/10?categoryId=1

### Tellimus koos ridadega
GET {{host}}/api/Orders/Get?Id=1

### Olematu tellimus -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/Orders/Get?Id=9999

### Uus tellimus
POST {{host}}/api/Orders/Save
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 0, "customerName": "Test Klient", "customerEmail": "test@example.com", "shippingAddress": "Pärnu mnt 1, Tallinn", "status": "New" }

### Vigane toode -> 400 koos vigadega
POST {{host}}/api/Products/Save
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 0, "name": "", "price": -5, "categoryId": 9999 }

### Toote fotod
GET {{host}}/api/Products/1/Files
